---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="页面未找到" description="这张书页还不存在。" noindex>
  <div class="narrow-container not-found">
    <span class="eyebrow">404 / MISPLACED CARD</span>
    <p class="not-found-code">404</p>
    <h1>这张索引卡不在书桌上。</h1>
    <p>链接可能已经变化，也可能这篇内容还没有整理出来。</p>
    <div class="hero-ctas">
      <a class="button button-primary" href="/">回到首页</a>
      <a class="button button-secondary" href="/search/">搜索书房</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
